 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.78,
   "text": "You don't lose friends in a fight. You lose them too. Let's catch up soon.\""
  },
  {
   "s": 3.78,
   "e": 7.86,
   "text": "Rohan found that out the hard way, and the fix he used took one calendar invite."
  },
  {
   "s": 8.28,
   "e": 12.8,
   "text": "Two years ago he moved cities for work. His three closest friends from college kept saying the same"
  },
  {
   "s": 12.8,
   "e": 17.88,
   "text": "thing. We should catch up soon. Then March went by. Then May. Then August. The last time all four"
  },
  {
   "s": 17.88,
   "e": 22.44,
   "text": "of them talked was seven months ago. Nobody stopped caring. The problem was that every"
  },
  {
   "s": 22.44,
   "e": 27.28,
   "text": "catch-up needed someone to plan it and everyone was busy. So Rohan stopped planning. He sent one"
  },
  {
   "s": 27.32,
   "e": 33.04,
   "text": "calendar invite. A video call the first Sunday of every month at 11. It repeats. Nobody has to"
  },
  {
   "s": 33.04,
   "e": 38.44,
   "text": "organize it again. In between calls, one small thing every Sunday. A short message to one friend"
  },
  {
   "s": 38.44,
   "e": 43.74,
   "text": "saw this and thought of you 30 seconds. Did everyone show up? Not every time. The first"
  },
  {
   "s": 43.74,
   "e": 48.58,
   "text": "month only two of them made it. But the next call was already in the calendar, so it didn't depend"
  },
  {
   "s": 48.58,
   "e": 52.86,
   "text": "on anyone remembering. Three months later they'd had three calls and they'd booked a weekend"
  },
  {
   "s": 52.86,
   "e": 58.2,
   "text": "trip for March. Same friends. Same busy lives. The only difference was a date that repeats."
  },
  {
   "s": 58.84,
   "e": 63.48,
   "text": "Here's the whole system. One repeating date. One message every Sunday. And if someone misses,"
  },
  {
   "s": 63.68,
   "e": 67.92,
   "text": "the next call is already set. Send this to the friend you keep saying let's catch up to."
  },
  {
   "s": 68.36,
   "e": 73.08,
   "text": "Rohan didn't need more time. Just a plan that runs by itself. Yours can too. That's what"
  },
  {
   "s": 73.08,
   "e": 77.68,
   "text": "Demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow and break it down"
  },
  {
   "s": 77.68,
   "e": 82.56,
   "text": "into small steps you can actually do. And follow because tomorrow's real is how to fit a big goal"
  },
  {
   "s": 82.56,
   "e": 87.58,
   "text": "into a busy week in three blocks. If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
  }
 ],
 "wps": 3.51
}